{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cfpg74aoxb3ZACmBqsT1F","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Discount Approval Decision: DR-9001\n\n## Analysis\n\n### 1. The Request\n- **ID:** DR-9001  \n- **Customer:** CRM-2048 (Acme Manufacturing) / C-1001 (Acme Mfg. Holdings)  \n- **Product:** NS-500  \n- **Requested discount:** 15%  \n- **Date:** 2026-09-23  \n- **Requestor:** Sarah Chen (sarah.chen@northstar.example)  \n- **Basis:** Contract pricing per Acme Master Supply Agreement\n\n### 2. The Customer\nCRM account CRM-2048 (Acme Manufacturing) maps to ERP customer C-1001 (Acme Mfg. Holdings). Strategic account, Midwest Enterprise.\n\n### 3. The Product\nNS-500 Industrial Controller. List price: $250,000.\n\n### 4. Active Contract\nThe request justifies the discount by reference to the \"Acme Master Supply Agreement.\" The account strategy document (ACCT-PLAN-CRM-2048-2026) confirms: \"Acme negotiated preferential NS-500 pricing in the 2025 agreement — I believe it's 15%, same as what we approved for them last September.\" An earlier request (DR-8104, 2025-09-16) for the same customer and product was approved at 15%.\n\n**However, the actual Acme Master Supply Agreement document is not located in the provided records.** The account strategy expresses a belief about its terms, but provides no definitive evidence of the contract or its scope.\n\n### 5. Pricing Exception\nNo pricing exception document is located for NS-500 on this date.\n\n### 6. Policy in Effect\n**Pricing Policy 2026** applies to requests dated 2026-09-23:\n- Enterprise Account Executives: ≤10%\n- VP Sales: >10% and ≤20%\n- Chief Revenue Officer: >20%\n\n### 7. Requestor's Authority\nSarah Chen is an Enterprise Account Executive. Her authority under the 2026 policy is discounts up to and including 10%.\n\n### 8. Required Approver\nThe requested discount of 15% exceeds Sarah's authority. Under the Approval Authority Matrix 2026, discounts >10% and ≤20% require VP Sales approval. **Michael Torres** (VP Sales) is the required approver.\n\n## Decision\n\nThe request relies on special terms (the Acme Master Supply Agreement) that cannot be located. Per the Sales Discount SOP and the procedure's principles: **\"If a request relies on a contract term that cannot be located, ask for the document before deciding.\"**\n\nEven if the contract is believed to permit 15%, and even though the same discount was approved before, a decision on this specific request requires sight of the contract that grounds the commercial eligibility.\n\n**Outcome: REQUEST_EVIDENCE**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REQUEST_EVIDENCE\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9001\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048); ERP: Acme Mfg. Holdings (C-1001)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-500\",\n    \"requested_discount\": 15.0,\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Sarah Chen\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"unknown\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": null,\n    \"basis\": \"Acme Master Supply Agreement — document not located\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"Pricing Policy 2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": 10,\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"VP Sales\",\n    \"approver\": \"Michael Torres\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"Discount request DR-9001 recorded in Northstar CRM with justification 'Contract pricing per Acme Master Supply Agreement'\",\n    \"Email from Sarah Chen to Michael Torres, 2026-09-23 09:14 CT, confirming Acme's request for 15% NS-500 discount and stating 'I think their agreement covers it'\",\n    \"Account Strategy 2026 (doc_id: ACCT-PLAN-CRM-2048-2026) by Sarah Chen, mentioning 'Acme negotiated preferential NS-500 pricing in the 2025 agreement — I believe it's 15%'\",\n    \"Previous discount DR-8104 approved 2025-09-16 for the same customer (CRM-2048), product (NS-500), and discount percentage (15%)\",\n    \"Organization chart: Sarah Chen confirmed as Enterprise Account Executive; Michael Torres as VP Sales\",\n    \"Pricing Policy 2026 (doc_id: PRICING-POLICY-2026) and Approval Authority Matrix 2026 (doc_id: APP-MATRIX-2026) establish authority thresholds\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [\n    \"Acme Master Supply Agreement document — the contract term cited as the basis for the discount\",\n    \"Explicit confirmation that the Master Supply Agreement is active on 2026-09-23\",\n    \"Written contract terms confirming 15% NS-500 pricing eligibility\"\n  ],\n  \"conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"what\": \"Provide the Acme Master Supply Agreement or relevant contract amendment that establishes the 15% NS-500 pricing term relied upon in request DR-9001\",\n      \"who\": \"Sarah Chen (requestor), Deal Desk, or Contract Management\",\n      \"blocking\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"what\": \"Confirm that the Master Supply Agreement is active, in force, and covers NS-500 product pricing on 2026-09-23\",\n      \"who\": \"Contract Management or Legal\",\n      \"blocking\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":24234,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":24234},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"26e918d7-c25c-4ac1-910b-96bbef7761f7","uuid":"d0a2b7d7-573f-403b-8f6d-ec02b81d3cfa","timestamp":"2026-10-08T11:16:48.704Z","request_id":"req_011Cfpg74NfWk73dmvHCpD3k"}
